        body: "Open the ... menu on the card P1 and choose Duplicate. On the copy, P3, switch the source at the top of the card from Region to Integers, then click its colour swatch and pick green.\n\nP3 keeps the objective of P1, but now searches the integer points only. Its marker lands on (4, 2). Rounding the relaxed optimum would not have found it: (5, 2) is infeasible, and (5, 1) is worse.",
        chart: chart2({ tools: [r1, relaxation, integerBest, lattice] }),
